BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162059@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260203T180000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be performing a maintenance outage of CROW Outage Scheduler in Production environment on Tuesday\, February 3rd 2026\, between 1:00 PM and 7:00 PM. 
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be performing a maintenance outage of CROW Outage Scheduler in Production environment on Tuesday\, February 3rd 2026\, between 1:00 PM and 7:00 PM. \n\nDuring this time\, Production CROW web application and web services will be intermittently unavailable.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162059
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162059
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162023@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260203T182000Z
SUMMARY:On Tuesday\, February 3\, 2026\, ISO New England will update the EMS/Market power system model between 13:20 and 15:45 hrs.
DESCRIPTION:On Tuesday\, February 3\, 2026\, subject to power system conditions\, ISO New England will update the EMS/Market power system model. The update is scheduled to start at approximately 13:20 and last until approximately 15:45. Participants can expect a loss of 5-minute Real Time LMP and RCP postings to the ISO's website and stale DDP signals to their Electronic Dispatch RTUs during this time period. Updated DDPs will resume upon completion of the EMS outage at approximately 15:45. External market applications will remain open during the outage\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162023
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162023
END:VEVENT
