UID:162231@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260210T200000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be taking a production maintenance outage of CROW Outage Scheduler on Tuesday February 10\, 2026\, from 3:00 PM EST to 6:00 PM EST. 
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be taking a production maintenance outage of CROW Outage Scheduler on Tuesday February 10\, 2026\, from 3:00 PM EST to 6:00 PM EST. CROW Outage Scheduler application and CROW web services will be unavailable during this time. Please contact Participant Support and Solutions if you have any questions.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162231
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162231
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162246@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260210T205600Z
SUMMARY:Calculation of Qualified Capacity for the Forward Capacity Market Monthly Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Window for April 2026
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1 Section III.13\, the updated Qualified Capacity for each Resource for April 2026 is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Tracking System (FCTS) under the Resource Position Summary. The amount of capacity that each Resource may transfer or acquire in the Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Window for April 2026 is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Market CSO Bilateral Contract Management UI under the terms Max Transferring Capacity and Max Acquiring Capacity.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162246
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162246
END:VEVENT
