SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Period for April 2026 Results Available
DESCRIPTION:The Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Period for April 2026 results have been approved. Updated Capacity Supply Obligation positions resulting from the Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Period can be found in the Forward Capacity Tracking System application under Commitment Period 2025-2026.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162279
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162279
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162280@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260213T153400Z
SUMMARY:Bid/Offer Limits Available for the Forward Capacity Market Third Annual Reconfiguration Auction for Capacity Commitment Period 2026-2027
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1 section III.13.4.2\, the amount of capacity that each Resource may bid or offer into the Forward Capacity Market Third Annual Reconfiguration Auction for Capacity Commitment Period 2026-2027 is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Market Reconfiguration Auction UI under the terms Max Demand Bid MW and Max Supply Offer MW.  In accordance with Market Rule 1\, section III. 13.5.4\, the nominal MW amount that each resource may enter into an Annual Reconfiguration Transaction is available for viewing in the Forward Capacity Market Reconfiguration Auction & ARTs application under Commitment Period 2026-27.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162280
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162280
END:VEVENT
