UID:162373@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260220T171200Z
SUMMARY:April 2026 FTR Bidding Window to Open
DESCRIPTION:The bidding window for the April 2026 FTR Prompt Auction and Balance of Planning Period will open on March 17\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on March 19\, 2026 (11:00 AM). The April 2026 FTR Auction results will be posted by March 31\, 2026. Registered FTR customers will find assumptions and related information for this auction posted on the FTR Assumptions page available by link from eFTR. For additional information\, please see the eFTR User Guide and ISO New England Manual for Financial Transmission Rights\, M-06\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162373
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162373
END:VEVENT
