BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162366@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260220T190000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of SMD Settlement Applications on Friday February 20\, 2025\, from 14:00 to 16:00 hrs.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of SMD Settlement Applications on Friday February 20\, 2025\, from 14:00 to 16:00 hrs. During the outage users will not be able to connect to the following SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load. The Financial Assurance Management application will also be unavailable. MIS Operational reports are delayed.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162366
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162366
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162378@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260220T200600Z
SUMMARY:Updates to the reporting frequency of the Forecast Capacity Analysis Report
DESCRIPTION:The frequency of the publication of the Forecast Capacity Analysis Report is changing effective on March 2\, 2026. The ISO is streamlining some Security-Constrained Reserve Adequacy (SCRA) processes\, eliminating two intraday cases that have redundancies with other reports. Details of the changes are provided in the Forecast Capacity Analysis Report knowledge article\, including the revised schedule and a note on the changes.\n\nIf you have questions regarding this message\, please contact the Participant Support and Solutions Team by submitting a case via Ask ISO\, emailing AskISO@iso-ne.com or by phone at (413) 540-4220.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162378
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162378
END:VEVENT
