BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:162395@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260222T163300Z
SUMMARY:Voltage Reduction Test – Alternate Date Confirmed (Thursday\, February 26)
DESCRIPTION:Due to the storm\, the system-wide 5% voltage reduction test originally scheduled for Tuesday\, February 24\, 2026\, will be conducted on the alternate date of Thursday\, February 26\, 2026. \n\nPlease note that this alternate date only applies to the 5% voltage reduction attainable within 10 minutes and will occur at 7pm. The 5% voltage reduction requiring more than 10 minutes to implement is now scheduled and implemented at the discretion of the individual Market Participant. \n\n\n\nPlease notify appropriate personnel in your organization accordingly.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162395
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162395
END:VEVENT
