SUMMARY:2025 Preliminary FCM Annual Peak Load
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England released the Forward Capacity Market\, Market Information Server (MIS) report entitled Special Annual Peak Load (SP_FCMANNUALPEAK) today\, February 24\, 2026. The information is preliminary and may be subject to change in the MDE RBA Process.\n\nThe 2025 preliminary annual peak load information has been included in the "ISO New England Annual System Peak Day\, Hour & Load MW" spreadsheet. This spreadsheet is located here.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162433
