SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market April 2026 Reconfiguration Auction Results Available
DESCRIPTION:The Forward Capacity Market April 2026 Reconfiguration Auction results have been approved. Updated Capacity Supply Obligation positions resulting from the auction approval can be found in the Forward Capacity Tracking System application under Commitment Period 2025-2026. Individual MIS reports can be found in the MIS reports titled SP_MRARESULT. The results summary for this auction can be found here.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162446
