UID:162458@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260226T163700Z
SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Period and Monthly Reconfiguration Auction for May 2026 to Open
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1\, Sections III.13.4 and III.13.5\, the submission period for submitting Capacity Supply Obligation Bilateral Contracts to the Forward Capacity Market CSO Bilateral Period for May 2026 will open on March 11\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on March 12\, 2026 (11:00). The submission period for submitting bids and offers to the Forward Capacity Market Monthly Reconfiguration Auction for May 2026 will open on March 19\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on March 20\, 2026 (11:00).\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162458
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162458
END:VEVENT
