DTSTART:20260226T210000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Sandbox Applications on Thursday Feb 26\, 2026 from 16:00 to 18:00 Hrs.
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will conduct an outage of Sandbox Settlement Applications on Thursday Feb 26\, 2026 from 16:00 to 18:00 Hrs. During the outage users will not be able to connect to the following Sandbox SMD Applications: Internal Transactions\, Submit Meter Reading\, Submit Peak Contribution\, Submit Monthly Regional Network Load\, Financial Assurance Management\, Sandbox eMKT\, Sandbox eFTR and Sandbox DRMUI.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=162485
