BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:161777@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260227T170000Z
DTEND:20260227T180000Z
SUMMARY:Office Hours with ISO-NE External Affairs
LOCATION:Teams
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England’s (ISO-NE) External Affairs department will host virtual office hours on Feb. 27. Following a brief introduction to ISO New England\, External Affairs staff will take questions from attendees. This event is designed for a non-technical audience to learn about ISO New England and is free and open to the public. Attendees are welcome to drop in any time during the office hours.\n\nFor more information on ISO New England\, see our We Are ISO video. The ISO’s External Affairs department maintains regular communication with state regulators and policymakers\, state and federal legislators\, governors\, attorneys general and consumer representatives in the six states served by ISO New England to provide information on the wholesale electricity markets and regional power system.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\n\nThis event will be held virtually via Teams:\n\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.com/meet/27254555088924?p=hfLWGDaSi2FPUxMQUQ\n\nMeeting ID: 272 545 550 889 24\n\nPasscode: Yk6W2io2\nContact: Kerry Schlichting (kschlichting@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161777
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161777
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:161478@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260227T004847Z
DTSTART:20260304T150000Z
DTEND:20260304T160000Z
SUMMARY:Webinar: Quarterly Settlements Forum
LOCATION:Webinar
DESCRIPTION:This webinar covers ISO New England settlements and billing.\n\nTopics include:\n\n\n	Cold Weather Impact\n	Pay-for-Performance (PFP) Rate\n	OATT and ISO Schedule Rate Changes\n	FCM Annual Peak (06/24/2025)\n	Metering Submission Timeline & Responsible Parties\n	2026 Settlement Forum Dates\n\n\nRegister Now!\nContact: Participant Training Services (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161478
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161478
END:VEVENT
